		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3948&amp;p=36880#p36880"><![CDATA[
The firmware you downloaded and used for the donor file for OpenGD77 (V26.45.bin) should work on that radio.  Any TYT firmware starting V2..... Should work with a V5 radio. <br><br>TYT numbering convention...<br><br>V0x.xx  is for V1 , V2 and V3 radios. (All have identical chipset)<br>V1x.xx  is for V4 radios. (Different synthesiser chip)<br>V2x.xx  is for V5 radios. (Different synthesiser and IF chips)<br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Wed Apr 23, 2025 2:57 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
